message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "UDER Experiment: AI-Assisted Invoice Transformation Evaluation Framework"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-26
authors:
  - family-names: Miletic
    given-names: Igor
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework for evaluating AI-assisted transformation of heterogeneous
  e-invoice representations (UBL, UN/CEFACT CII, OAGIS-derived JSON) into a common local
  invoice model, with ground-truth-based, non-AI-judged metrics.
keywords:
  - e-invoicing
  - LLM evaluation
  - semantic interoperability
  - UBL
  - UN/CEFACT CII
